---
// 组织层次示意图（非真实比例）。只画一条肌皮穿支，用于说明“从深处来 → 穿过深筋膜 → 在皮下分支 → 连到真皮下血管网”。
---
<figure class="layer-fig">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 680 380" role="img" aria-labelledby="layer-title layer-desc" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <title id="layer-title">皮肤与皮下组织层次示意图</title>
    <desc id="layer-desc">从上到下依次为表皮、真皮、皮下组织、深筋膜、肌肉。一条皮穿支从肌肉深面的源血管发出，向上穿过肌肉和深筋膜，在皮下组织内分支，终末分支连到真皮下方的血管网。示意图，非真实比例。</desc>
    <!-- 层次 -->
    <rect x="20" y="30" width="460" height="12" fill="#e9c9a8" />
    <rect x="20" y="42" width="460" height="52" fill="#f3dccb" />
    <rect x="20" y="94" width="460" height="104" fill="#fbf1c7" />
    <rect x="20" y="198" width="460" height="9" fill="#c9d3df" />
    <rect x="20" y="207" width="460" height="108" fill="#e6b3ae" />
    <rect x="20" y="315" width="460" height="45" fill="#f4eeee" />
    <!-- 肌纤维纹理 -->
    <g stroke="#d3958f" stroke-width="1">
      <line x1="20" y1="230" x2="480" y2="230" /><line x1="20" y1="255" x2="480" y2="255" /><line x1="20" y1="280" x2="480" y2="280" /><line x1="20" y1="303" x2="480" y2="303" />
    </g>
    <!-- 真皮下血管网（细线） -->
    <path d="M40 92 Q90 86 140 92 T240 92 T340 92 T460 92" fill="none" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
    <!-- 源血管 -->
    <rect x="40" y="328" width="420" height="12" rx="6" fill="#c0392b" />
    <!-- 皮穿支：从源血管向上穿过肌肉、深筋膜，在皮下分支 -->
    <path d="M250 330 C250 300 244 260 248 207 C250 180 250 150 250 120" fill="none" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path d="M250 165 C230 150 200 130 175 100" fill="none" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path d="M250 150 C275 135 305 118 330 98" fill="none" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path d="M250 120 C246 110 240 102 232 94" fill="none" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path d="M250 120 C256 110 262 102 272 94" fill="none" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <!-- 穿出深筋膜的位置 -->
    <circle cx="248" cy="202" r="9" fill="none" stroke="#12305a" stroke-width="2" />
    <!-- 标注 -->
    <g font-size="14" fill="#1c2430" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif">
      <text x="492" y="40">表皮（无血管）</text>
      <text x="492" y="72">真皮</text>
      <text x="492" y="150">皮下组织（以脂肪为主）</text>
      <text x="492" y="207">深筋膜</text>
      <text x="492" y="262">肌肉</text>
      <text x="492" y="340">较深层的源血管</text>
    </g>
    <g font-size="13" fill="#12305a" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif">
      <line x1="262" y1="204" x2="330" y2="232" stroke="#12305a" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="334" y="238">穿出深筋膜处</text>
      <line x1="342" y1="98" x2="372" y2="118" stroke="#12305a" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="358" y="134">在皮下分支</text>
      <line x1="120" y1="90" x2="100" y2="66" stroke="#12305a" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="30" y="62">真皮下血管网</text>
      <text x="258" y="290">皮穿支（此处为穿过肌肉的走法）</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption><strong>示意图，非真实比例。</strong>为看清结构，各层厚度和血管粗细都做了放大或简化；只画了一条穿过肌肉的皮穿支（肌皮穿支），肌间隔穿支沿肌肉间隔上行，路径不同。颜色只用于区分层次。</figcaption>
</figure>
